sequenceDiagram
    %% SD1 - Find recycling facilities
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 14, 36, 48
    %% Description: A user finds nearby facilities by zip code and on a map, narrows them by waste type and opening hours, and opens an address in Google Maps.
    actor UP as User (person)
    participant RF as RecyclingFacility
    participant WT as WasteType
    participant SC as Schedule

    %% covers 2, 3, 14
    UP->>RF: find facilities by zip code
    %% covers 36
    UP->>RF: view facilities on a map
    %% covers 6
    UP->>RF: select waste types
    RF->>WT: accepted waste types
    %% covers 4
    UP->>RF: get opening hours
    RF->>SC: opening hours
    %% covers 48
    UP->>RF: see environment-friendly facilities
    %% covers 1
    UP->>RF: get directions to a facility
